  "body": "## What\n\nChoose DuckDB 1.5.5 for the first JSON lines analysis, Quarto 1.10.18 `.qmd` with the Jupyter Python engine, and Matplotlib 3.11.2 for static SVG charts. Record a claim ledger, independent recomputation rule, deterministic row sample, chart/table review, and private-input boundaries.\n\n## Why\n\nIssues #100 and #103 need a reviewed analysis method before #107 makes it executable. This PR confines the research gate to issue #104's eight approved documentation and evidence paths. #107 owns dependency pins, notebook tasks, CI, privacy exclusions, and the synthetic runnable example.\n\n## Evidence\n\nHarness: Codex CLI 0.157.1. Model: `gpt-6-sol` at high effort.\n\n- [Comparison and recorded commands](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/blob/4b9536b55e2cd88b31e41c659edeec77c8174a21/research/gates/data-analysis/notes.md), [tagged source versions and commits](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/blob/4b9536b55e2cd88b31e41c659edeec77c8174a21/research/gates/data-analysis/versions.md), and [verification protocol with worked paper example](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/blob/4b9536b55e2cd88b31e41c659edeec77c8174a21/research/gates/data-analysis/verification-protocol.md).\n- `mise run fmt`, `mise run check`, `mise run check:mutation`, `mise run build`, `mise run docs:build`, targeted Vale, and staged secret hooks passed before the merge from `main`. The PR changes 225 lines of documentation and no code.\n- After merging `main` into the branch, local `check` attempts were limited by sandbox-local tool and temporary cache failures. The local mutation retry passed. CI on commit `1edea11` concluded `success` for `check`, `docs`, `mutation`, `pr-body`, and `imported-research`.\n- `mise run docs:check-links` exited 1 locally on three existing links in untouched files. Chromium logged a sandbox Mach registration denial. The CI `docs` job passed.\n- Notebook execution and cross-platform byte-for-byte SVG equality remain untested here and are assigned to #107.\n\n## Docs\n\nAdd [decision 0008](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/blob/4b9536b55e2cd88b31e41c659edeec77c8174a21/docs/src/content/docs/decisions/0008-analysis-notebooks.md), [decision 0009](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/blob/4b9536b55e2cd88b31e41c659edeec77c8174a21/docs/src/content/docs/decisions/0009-analysis-visualization.md), the [data analysis conventions](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/blob/4b9536b55e2cd88b31e41c659edeec77c8174a21/docs/src/content/docs/guides/data-analysis-conventions.md), and guide and decision index entries.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] CI concluded successfully: check, docs, mutation, pr-body, and imported-research.\n- [x] Docs are updated.\n- [x] No secrets are included.\n- [x] Research evidence is committed.\n\nRefs: #104\n",
